      "description": "The Corgi U.S. Equities 30% Structured Buffer ETF - September Series (CTSE) is an exchange-traded fund that mostly invests in downside hedge alternatives. The fund seeks to provide investors with returns that generally match the price return (excluding dividends) of the SPDR S&P 500 ETF Trust (the Underlying ETF), up to the upside cap of 14.70% while providing a buffer against losses of the Underlying ETF for losses between -5% and -35%, over the period from September 1, 2026 to August 31, 2027. CTSE was launched on Sep 14, 2026 and is issued by Corgi.",
